WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Standing heavy kick punishes Ryu near the corner.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.750
Jamie uses raw Drive Rush after the heavy-kick Punish Counter.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.500
The launcher lifts Ryu during the Rush.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Jumping heavy kick carries the juggle toward the wall.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.650
Crouching heavy kick catches Ryu at the corner.

6
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:05.900
The target drink completes the corner knockdown.
